      "pulled": "2026-10-12",
      "verbatim": "Most emails were non deliverable. ... the data quality was so poor that we decided not to move forward. ... We are now stuck in a contract that does not reflect what we were told when we signed up ... Stick to the likes of Lusha, clay, Apollo! ... Outdated and inaccurate! ... Wrong email and phone number."
    },
    {
      "id": "src:2",
